.* NETWORK: the task menu for network management.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='NETWORK'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=NETWORK HELP=HLPNETWORK KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Network Management
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD DSPNETA'.Display network attributes
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CHGNETA'.Change network attributes
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD DSPSOCSTS'.Display sphere of control (SOC) status
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKSOC'.Work with sphere of control (SOC)
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU NETPRB'.Network problem handling
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD DSPAPPNINF'.Display APPN information
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD WRKDSTQ'.Work with distribution queues
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD DSPDSTSRV'.Display distribution services
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD DSPDSTLOG'.Display distribution services log
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU TCPADM'.TCP/IP administration
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='MENU SVSM'.SystemView System Manager
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='CMD CFGTCPSNMP'.Configure SNMP agent
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDNET'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPNETWORK.Network Management - Help
:P.The network as a whole: the system's network attributes, distribution
services and TCP/IP.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
